aces que s&#x27;ofereixen, les notes de tall, l&#x27;accés i l&#x27;admissió, així com els ajuts i les beques que tens a la teva disposició. Consulta el calendari de les jornades de portes obertes de grau i de les sessions informatives de màster. </p></div></div><form class=\"block-buscador__search-bar\" role=\"search\" aria-label=\"Cerca a la UPC\"><label for=\"buscador-input\" class=\"visually-hidden\">Cerca a la UPC</label><input id=\"buscador-input\" class=\"block-buscador__input\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Introdueix la teva cerca...\" aria-label=\"Cerca a la UPC\" autoComplete=\"off\" value=\"\"/><button type=\"button\" class=\"block-buscador__button homeupc-button homeupc-button--primary homeupc-button--search\" aria-label=\"CERCAR\"><span class=\"block-buscador__button-text homeupc-button__label\">CERCAR</span><i class=\"icon-glyph icon-glyph--inline block-buscador__button-icon homeupc-button__icon\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;line-height:0;max-width:100%;color:inherit;box-sizing:border-box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon-glyph__svg\" focusable=\"false\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:100%\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M6.93853 2.60896C7.90914 2.20693 8.94943 2 10 2C11.0506 2 12.0909 2.20693 13.0615 2.60896C14.0321 3.011 14.914 3.60028 15.6569 4.34315C16.3997 5.08601 16.989 5.96793 17.391 6.93853C17.7931 7.90914 18 8.94943 18 10C18 11.0506 17.7931 12.0909 17.391 13.0615C17.1172 13.7226 16.7565 14.3425 16.3196 14.9054L21.7071 20.2929C22.0976 20.6834 22.0976 21.3166 21.7071 21.7071C21.3166 22.0976 20.6834 22.0976 20.2929 21.7071L14.9054 16.3196C14.3425 16.7565 13.7226 17.1172 13.0615 17.391C12.0909 17.7931 11.0506 18 10 18C8.94943 18 7.90914 17.7931 6.93853 17.391C5.96793 16.989 5.08601 16.3997 4.34315 15.6569C3.60028 14.914 3.011 14.0321 2.60896 13.0615C2.20693 12.0909 